  },
  "question": {
    "text": "<p><math><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></math> is a plane lamina of the shape of an equilateral triangle. <math><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow></math> are mid-points of <math><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></math> and <math><mi>G</mi></math> is the centroid of the lamina. Moment of inertia of the lamina about an axis passing through <math><mi>G</mi></math> and perpendicular to the plane <math><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></math> is <math><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></math>. If part <math><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></math> is removed, the moment of inertia of the remaining part about the same axis is <math><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> where <math><mi>N</mi></math> is an integer. Value of <math><mi>N</mi></math> is:</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0156_8e3fb25232ba.png\" style=\"width: 109px; height: 110px;\" />&nbsp;</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "11",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0156_8284a10e58b0.png\" style=\"width: 136px; height: 141px;\" /></p><p>Let mass of lamina&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></math>, and length of side&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></math>, then moment of inertila of lamina about an axis passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math>&nbsp;and perpendicular to the plane.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>m</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0156_94996b70c856.png\" style=\"width: 156px; height: 161px;\" /></p><p>Let moment of inertila of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi></math></p><p>then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>then,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, Moment of inertila of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn><msub><mi>I</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">1</mn></msub><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">I</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub></mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">16</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">I</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">16</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">11</mn><msub><mi>I</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub></mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">16</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}